## Prior art and reused ideas

- `dsh-cursor-provider` by Kaczev (MIT): the adapter/registration structure,
  host-owned custom-tool bridge, session-prefix reuse, bounded timeout behavior,
  catalog parameter normalization, and image projection informed this
  implementation. No plugin-detail UI or API-key-only flow is copied.
- `Sdju/projector` `plugins/cursor`: local Cursor CLI authentication and the
  `GetCurrentPeriodUsage` ConnectRPC request/response fields, plus the
  Total/Auto/API quota-window labels. The ACP transport and the EU-network
  probe are deliberately not used.
- `omp-cursor`: the uncertainty/cancellation posture — an interrupted run is
  disposed rather than resumed, a continuation is single-use, cleanup is
  bounded, and an unknown terminal state never triggers an automatic paid
  retry.

